cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "autocycle: figures and stoichiometric checks for autocatalytic cycles"
abstract: >-
  Draws reaction cycles and synthetic routes from a YAML spec or a network search, and
  reports whether a drawn cycle is autocatalytic, reading it both as stated stoichiometry
  and as a steady state in the sense of Clarke.
type: software
authors:
